{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If an object is within range, move and grab it. Check the properties. If not, scan for objects. Do a specific task if needed.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToGrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinRange    /> <Condition ID = IsSpecificTaskNeeded    />",
